<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  {% include "seo_head.html.j2" %}
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #0f0f0f;
      --panel: #161616;
      --fg: #f8f8f2;
      --faded: #f8f8f2cf;
      --grey: #888889;
      --border: #3e3e35;
      --accent: #ff6c60;
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    html {
      -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;
    }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 1.5rem;
      background: var(--bg);
      color: var(--fg);
      font-family:
        system-ui,
        -apple-system,
        "Segoe UI",
        sans-serif;
      font-size: 16px;
      line-height: 1.65;
    }

    main {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 34rem;
      background: var(--panel);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 6px;
      padding: 2.25rem 2rem;
    }

    .logo {
      display: block;
      width: 46px;
      height: 46px;
      margin: 0 0 1.25rem;
      image-rendering: -webkit-optimize-contrast;
    }

    h1 {
      margin: 0 0 1.5rem;
      font-size: 1.4rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--accent);
      letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    }

    p {
      margin: 0 0 1.1rem;
    }

    p:last-of-type,
    p:has(+ hr) {
      margin-bottom: 0;
    }

    hr {
      margin: 1.75rem 0 1.25rem;
      border: 0;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    }

    footer {
      color: var(--grey);
      font-size: 0.9rem;
    }

    h2 {
      margin: 0 0 0.9rem;
      font-size: 1rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--fg);
      letter-spacing: 0.02em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    a {
      color: var(--accent);
      text-decoration: none;
      border-bottom: 1px solid transparent;
    }

    a:hover {
      border-bottom-color: var(--accent);
    }

    .links {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 0.4rem 1.15rem;
      margin: 0 0 1.25rem;
      padding: 0;
      list-style: none;
    }

    dl {
      margin: 0;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: max-content minmax(0, 1fr);
      align-items: baseline;
      gap: 0.45rem 1rem;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
    }

    dt {
      color: var(--grey);
      font-weight: 600;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    dd {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Consolas, monospace;
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      color: var(--faded);
      word-break: break-all;
      line-height: 1.5;
      -webkit-user-select: all;
      user-select: all;
    }

    details {
      margin: 0;
    }

    summary {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.55rem;
      width: max-content;
      margin-left: -0.95rem;
      cursor: pointer;
      list-style: none;
      font-size: 1rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: 0.02em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--grey);
      transition: color 0.15s ease;
    }

    summary::-webkit-details-marker {
      display: none;
    }

    summary:hover,
    details[open] summary {
      color: var(--fg);
    }

    summary:focus-visible {
      outline: 1px solid var(--accent);
      outline-offset: 5px;
      border-radius: 2px;
    }

    summary::before {
      content: "";
      flex: none;
      width: 0.4rem;
      height: 0.4rem;
      border-right: 1.5px solid currentColor;
      border-bottom: 1.5px solid currentColor;
      transform: translateY(-0.06em) rotate(-45deg);
      transition: transform 0.2s ease;
    }

    details[open] summary::before {
      transform: translateY(-0.16em) rotate(45deg);
    }

    .donations {
      margin-top: 1.35rem;
      animation: reveal 0.2s ease;
    }

    @keyframes reveal {
      from {
        opacity: 0;
        transform: translateY(-0.2rem);
      }
    }

    .contact {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
    }

    @media (max-width: 480px) {
      main {
        padding: 1.75rem 1.35rem;
      }

      h1 {
        font-size: 1.25rem;
      }

      dl {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        gap: 0.15rem;
      }

      dt {
        margin-top: 0.5rem;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>
  <main>
    <h1>Cease and desist</h1>

    <p>
      On 24 August 2026 cease and desist letters have been sent by
      X&nbsp;Corp. demanding a permanent takedown of Nitter instances and the
      project's repository.
    </p>

    <p>
      Development has stopped for the time being.
      For more info see the official nitter.net statement.
    </p>

    <p>
      Thank you to everyone who used, hosted, packaged, donated and
      contributed to Nitter over the past seven years.
    </p>

    <hr />

    <footer>&mdash; 28 August 2026 · <a href="/">Instance status</a></footer>
  </main>
</body>

</html>
